@startuml
title Biểu đồ tuần tự: SQ13 - Báo cáo thống kê hiệu quả kinh doanh & Dashboard

autonumber
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Đối tác" as DT
boundary ":PartnerDashboardPage" as UI
control ":PartnerDashboardController" as Ctrl
entity ":PartnerDashboardService" as Svc

== 1. Lấy số liệu thống kê tổng quan (Dashboard Overview) ==
DT -> UI: openDashboardOverview()
UI -> Ctrl: getOverview()
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: getOverview(partnerId)
activate Svc
Svc --> Ctrl: return {\n  total_programs, pending_approval,\n  active_programs, total_sold,\n  total_redeemed, total_revenue\n}
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (overviewData)
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> DT: renderKpiCardsAndOverviewCharts(overviewData)

== 2. Lấy thống kê chi tiết theo từng chương trình Voucher ==
DT -> UI: selectVoucherReport(program_id)
UI -> Ctrl: getVoucherStats(program_id)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: getVoucherStats(partnerId, programId)
activate Svc
Svc --> Ctrl: return rows
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (rows)
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> DT: displayVoucherStatsTable(rows)

@enduml
